{"id":"7f5ccad530252cff","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-extendible.md","title":"Extendible Cardinal","display":"thm-extendible — Extendible Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-extendible","aliases":["58-thm-extendible"],"display":"thm-extendible — Extendible Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-extendible]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-extendible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-extendible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-extendible — Extendible Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"955facc376d59b85\" href=\"?note=955facc376d59b85\" title=\"58-df-extendible\">58-df-extendible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Extendible},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Extendible},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extendible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\mu,j\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\mu)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extendible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\mu,j\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\mu)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Extendible cardinals have embeddings moving the entire universe.</li>\n<li>Extendible cardinals imply strong partition properties.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"955facc376d59b85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Extendible},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extendible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\\to\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa<\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\mu,j\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\mu)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\lambda<j(\\kappa)\\right)\\right)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1033,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-extendible.md|58-thm-extendible]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["955facc376d59b85","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}